      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<div style=\"position:relative;\">\n    <div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:34px;padding:34px 40px;margin-top:24px;\"><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#03402F;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">Förklaring</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:22px;\">Vik ut det klippta arket, en vikning i taget.</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 140 180\" width=\"179\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"120\" height=\"160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(10,10,10,0.22)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"0\" width=\"30\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#F0EEE7\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 90.0 46.2 L 90.0 33.8 L 96.2 40.0 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><line x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"33.8\" x2=\"96.2\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"96.2\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"90.0\" y2=\"46.2\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 90.0 0 L 120.0 0 M 90.0 80 L 120.0 80 M 90 0.0 L 90 80.0 M 120 0.0 L 120 80.0 \" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    \n  </svg></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:25px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.6);text-align:center;line-height:1.3;\">Vikt 3 gånger och klippt</div>\n    </div><div style=\"font-size:46px;font-weight:900;color:#056B50;line-height:0.9;margin:4px 0;\">↓</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 140 180\" width=\"179\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"120\" height=\"160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgb